{"author": "hattrill", "body": "\n**Update annotations/mapping for tah18/NDOR1**\n\nNew term for [NADPH-iron-sulfur [2Fe-2S] protein oxidoreductase activity](https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/29668)\ncan be used to update mapping for \n1. IPR028879 NADPH-dependent diflavin oxidoreductase 1: \nReplace NADPH-hemoprotein reductase activity (GO:0003958) with NADPH-iron-sulfur [2Fe-2S] protein oxidoreductase activity  (GO:0160246)\n2. To annotate s.cerevisiae [tah18](https://www.yeastgenome.org/locus/S000006252) \t\nupdate oxidoreductase activity, acting on NAD(P)H  PMID:20802492 to the more specific GO:0160246.", "created_at": "2025-02-18T10:28:16Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["FlyBase", "InterPro mapping", "mitochondrion"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Annotation update for NADPH-dependent diflavin oxidoreductase 1", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2025-04-22T12:32:21Z"}
